<%= tag.h1 page.title = "Namespace request received!" %>

<p>We've received your application to have <%= tag.i @sign_up.submission.name %>, and we'll be in touch shortly.</p>

<h3 style="margin-block-start: 3em;">Verify your email address now</h3>

<p>In the meantime, we've sent you an email to verify your email address. Click on the link in the email to verify your address.</p>

<h3 style="margin-block-start: 3em;">Want another namespace?</h3>

<p>We support multiple namespaces per person on the same email address.</p>

<%= link_to "Sign up another namespace", sign_up_url(sign_up_params.except(:namespace_name)) %>
